# Local development only. Copy this file to .dev.vars (which git ignores) and
# fill in a value to have `wrangler dev` ask NVIDIA's API first. Leave it empty,
# or skip the copy, and the assistant runs on Workers AI alone.
#
# In production the same name is a Worker secret, set once with:
#   npx wrangler secret put NVIDIA_API_KEY
NVIDIA_API_KEY=
